{"speciesId":583,"names":{"fr":"Sorboul","es":"Vanillish","en":"Vanillish","ja":"バニリッチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon qui vit dans les montagnes enneigées. Il a émigré au sud durant l’ère glaciaire, il y a bien longtemps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Snowy mountains are this Pokémon’s habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se cache de ses ennemis en émettant une myriade de petites particules de glace."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It conceals itself from enemy eyes by creating many small ice particles and hiding among them."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il pétrifie ses ennemis en refroidissant l’air ambiant et en le changeant en une myriade de petites particules de glace."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Enfrían el aire a su alrededor y crean partículas de hielo mediante las cuales congelan a sus oponentes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"辺りの 空気を 冷やして 氷の 粒を 発生 させて 敵の 体を 凍りつかせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon qui vit dans les montagnes enneigées. Il a émigré au sud durant l’ère glaciaire, il y a bien longtemps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en las cumbres nevadas. Migró hacia el sur durante la era glaciar hace muchísimos años."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Snowy mountains are this Pokémon’s habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"雪山に 生息する ポケモン。 大昔 氷河期の ときに 南の 土地に 移動してきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il pétrifie ses ennemis en refroidissant l’air ambiant et en le changeant en une myriade de petites particules de glace."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Enfrían el aire a su alrededor y crean partículas de hielo mediante las cuales congelan a sus oponentes."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"辺りの 空気を 冷やして 氷の 粒を 発生 させて 敵の 体を 凍りつかせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon qui vit dans les montagnes enneigées. Il a émigré au sud durant l’ère glaciaire, il y a bien longtemps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en las cumbres nevadas. Migró hacia el sur durante la era glaciar hace muchísimos años."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Snowy mountains are this Pokémon’s habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"雪山に 生息する ポケモン。 大昔 氷河期の ときに 南の 土地に 移動してきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Son corps fond les jours de canicule. Il suffit heureusement de le congeler pour qu’il reprenne forme, mais il restera un tantinet flagada."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su cuerpo se derrite en los días calurosos. Al congelarse recobra su aspecto original, aunque ligeramente deformado."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Hot days cause its body to melt. It can be restored by refreezing it, but the process leaves its body slightly warped."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"暑い 日には 身体が 溶ける。 凍らせれば 元に 戻るけど 身体の 形は 少し 歪む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Déjà présent à l’ère glaciaire, ce Pokémon peut contrôler les particules de glace pour geler ses ennemis, qu’il éclate ensuite d’un coup de boule."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Sus orígenes se remontan a la era glacial. Usa partículas de hielo para congelar a su enemigo y hacerlo después añicos de un cabezazo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon has existed since the Ice Age. It controls particles of ice, freezes its opponents, and then shatters them with a headbutt."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"氷河期から 存在 している。 氷の 粒を 操って 敵を 凍らせたあと 頭突きで 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il souffle des particules de glace pour geler ses ennemis. Les Sorboul d’Alola sont plus petits que la moyenne."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Exhala partículas de hielo para congelar a sus rivales. Los Vanillish de la región de Alola son más pequeños que el resto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It sprays its enemies with grains of ice to freeze them. Most Vanillish in Alola are smaller than average."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"氷の粒を 吹きかけて 敵の 身体を 凍らせる。 アローラの バニリッチは 全体的に 小柄。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce robuste Pokémon a survécu à l’ère glaciaire. Il est extrêmement populaire dans les régions chaudes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon muy resistente que logró sobrevivir a la glaciación. En las regiones cálidas goza de gran popularidad."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This hearty Pokémon survived the Ice Age. It’s incredibly popular in very hot regions."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"氷河期を 生き抜いた とても たくましい ポケモン。 こと 暑い 地方では 抜群の 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il boit de l’eau pure pour gonfler son corps de glace. On le voit rarement les jours ensoleillés."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Bebe agua pura para agrandar su cuerpo de hielo. Apenas se ven ejemplares durante los días soleados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"By drinking pure water, it grows its icy body. This Pokémon can be hard to find on days with warm, sunny weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"きれいな 水を 飲んで 氷の 体を 大きくする。 天気の 良い 日は あまり 見かけない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien qu’il gèle ses ennemis en soufflant de l’air à - 100 °C, sa gentillesse l’empêche de leur ôter la vie."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Congela a sus enemigos con un vaho a -100 °C, pero no llega a arrebatarles la vida debido a su carácter benévolo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It blasts enemies with cold air reaching −148 degrees Fahrenheit, freezing them solid. But it spares their lives afterward—it’s a kind Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"マイナス１００度の 冷気で 敵を 凍らせるが 命までは 奪わない 優しい 気質。"}],"varieties":[{"id":583,"moves":[{"name":"mist","learns":[[11,"level-up",16],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[11,"level-up",36],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",36],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",36],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",36],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",36],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",36],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",44],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[11,"level-up",53],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",53],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",53],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",53],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",53],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",53],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",50],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"mac